ronment with relaxation resources, open to all UNH students Monday through Friday from 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.","source_url":"https://www.unh.edu/student-success/center-academic-resources/resources/study-spaces","source_title":"Study Spaces | The Center for Academic Resources","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to all UNH students; scan the posted QR code to check in. Listed hours: Monday–Friday, 8:00 a.m.–4:30 p.m.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unh-graduate-study-carrels-441","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Graduate Study Carrels, Room 441","title":"Graduate Study Carrels","subtitle":"Dimond Library, Level 4, Room 441","notes":"Graduate students can request the room combination at the Level 3 Information Desk with a valid graduate UNH ID, then use available carrels for quiet work.","short_summary":"A quiet Level 4 carrel room reserved for graduate students.","evidence_claim":"UNH provides unassigned carrels and seating for graduate students in Dimond Library Room 441 for quiet study; a valid graduate UNH ID is required to obtain the room combination.","source_url":"https://library.unh.edu/services/spaces-study-work/graduate-study-carrels","source_title":"Graduate Study Carrels | Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For graduate students; bring a valid graduate UNH ID to the Dimond Level 3 Information Desk for the room combination.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unh-studio-235","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Studio 235","title":"Studio 235","subtitle":"Dimond Library, Level 2","notes":"Reserve this room for a film-related project or presentation rehearsal; it has seating for up to 24, an 80-inch TV, playback gear, and dry-erase boards.","short_summary":"A reservable Level 2 media room for screening and presentation work.","evidence_claim":"UNH says instructors and students may reserve Studio 235 in Dimond Library; it includes tables and chairs for up to 24 people, an 80-inch TV, playback equipment, and two dry-erase boards.","source_url":"https://library.unh.edu/services/spaces-study-work/studio-235","source_title":"Studio 235 | Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on Dimond Library Level 2; reserve online for film showings or related work.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unh-geospatial-services-center-337","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Geospatial Services Center","title":"Geospatial Services Center","subtitle":"Dimond Library, Room 337","notes":"Use the seven high-performance workstations for a GIS task, and bring your UNH AD login; group consultations are welcome when they do not disrupt others.","short_summary":"A specialized GIS lab with high-performance workstations and support.","evidence_claim":"UNH’s Geospatial Services Center lab in Dimond Room 337 is open for GIS use during Dimond Library hours, has seven high-performance workstations, and primarily serves UNH students, faculty, and staff.","source_url":"https://library.unh.edu/research-support/geospatial-services-center","source_title":"Geospatial Services Center | Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"UNH AD login is required for the workstations; access to some software is limited to the UNH community.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unh-daggett-instruction-room-421","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Daggett Instruction Room 421","title":"Daggett Instruction Room 421","subt